---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import { COMPANY } from '../../site.config';
import { withBase } from '../../nav';

const h2 = 'text-2xl font-bold text-brand-900';
const p = 'text-base/[1.7] text-copy';
const link = 'font-semibold text-brand-900 underline hover:no-underline';
---

<Layout
  title="Our Governance"
  description={`${COMPANY.legalName} corporate governance framework: Code of Conduct, ABAC Policy, Data Protection, and Whistleblowing.`}
>
  <PageHero
    crumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: withBase('/') }, { label: 'Our Governance' }]}
    eyebrow="Governance"
    title="Our Governance"
    intro="Corporate Governance Framework and Compliance Policies"
  />
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-3xl flex-col gap-12 px-8 pt-12 pb-16">
    <header class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <p class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-900">Our Commitment to Integrity</p>
      <p class={p}>
        At {COMPANY.legalName}, we believe that robust corporate governance is the foundation of sustainable business growth and client trust. As a provider of business-ready networking, virtualization, and security solutions, we are committed to maintaining the highest standards of integrity, accountability, and ethical conduct in all our operations.
      </p>
      <p class={p}>
        Our governance framework is designed to ensure strict regulatory compliance, protect our clients' sensitive infrastructure, and foster a culture of transparency across our organization.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section aria-labelledby="code-of-conduct" class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <h2 id="code-of-conduct" class={h2}>1. Code of Business Conduct and Ethics</h2>
      <p class={p}>
        Our Code of Conduct establishes the baseline for professional behavior for all {COMPANY.legalName} employees, directors, and contractors.
      </p>
      <ul class="flex list-disc flex-col gap-2 pl-6 marker:text-brand-900">
        <li class={p}><strong>Integrity in IT Operations:</strong> We mandate strict vendor neutrality and unbiased technical recommendations, ensuring our hardware, software, and deployment solutions serve the client's best interests without external bias.</li>
        <li class={p}><strong>Confidentiality:</strong> Given our role in deploying enterprise networks and security infrastructure, all personnel are bound by strict non-disclosure agreements regarding client topologies, IP addressing, video surveillance configurations, and security vulnerabilities.</li>
        <li class={p}><strong>Conflict of Interest:</strong> Employees must disclose any personal or financial interests that could influence business decisions, particularly in procurement, project bidding, and vendor selection.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="anti-bribery" class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <h2 id="anti-bribery" class={h2}>2. Anti-Bribery and Corruption (ABAC) Policy</h2>
      <p class={p}>
        {COMPANY.legalName} strictly prohibits all forms of bribery and corruption, operating in full compliance with the Malaysian Anti-Corruption Commission (MACC) Act 2009.
      </p>
      <ul class="flex list-disc flex-col gap-2 pl-6 marker:text-brand-900">
        <li class={p}><strong>Zero Tolerance:</strong> We do not offer, give, solicit, or accept bribes, kickbacks, or improper facilitation payments to secure business advantages or expedite technical services.</li>
        <li class={p}><strong>Gifts and Hospitality:</strong> Any exchange of corporate gifts or hospitality with vendors or clients must be reasonable, transparent, and accurately recorded in our financial ledgers to prevent any perception of undue influence.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="data-protection" class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <h2 id="data-protection" class={h2}>3. Data Protection and Privacy</h2>
      <p class={p}>
        As a technology partner, safeguarding data is embedded in our operational DNA. We fully comply with the Personal Data Protection Act (PDPA) 2010.
      </p>
      <ul class="flex list-disc flex-col gap-2 pl-6 marker:text-brand-900">
        <li class={p}><strong>Data Minimization:</strong> We collect and process only the personal and corporate data strictly necessary to fulfill our service-level agreements and network deployment contracts.</li>
        <li class={p}><strong>Infrastructure Security:</strong> We apply stringent industry best practices to secure our internal systems and client deployments against unauthorized access, data breaches, and cyber threats.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="whistleblowing" class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <h2 id="whistleblowing" class={h2}>4. Whistleblowing Policy</h2>
      <p class={p}>
        {COMPANY.legalName} provides a secure, confidential channel for employees, partners, and clients to report suspected misconduct, fraud, or violations of our governance policies.
      </p>
      <ul class="flex list-disc flex-col gap-2 pl-6 marker:text-brand-900">
        <li class={p}><strong>Protection from Retaliation:</strong> We guarantee that any individual making a report in good faith will be protected from harassment, demotion, or retaliatory action.</li>
        <li class={p}><strong>Reporting Channels:</strong> Reports can be submitted directly to our Management Team via confidential email or through written correspondence to our headquarters.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="supply-chain" class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <h2 id="supply-chain" class={h2}>5. Supply Chain and Partner Governance</h2>
      <p class={p}>
        Our commitment to security extends entirely through our hardware and software supply chains.
      </p>
      <ul class="flex list-disc flex-col gap-2 pl-6 marker:text-brand-900">
        <li class={p}><strong>Vendor Vetting:</strong> We exclusively partner with reputable technology vendors and authorized distributors. We require our suppliers to adhere to equivalent ethical, labor, and cybersecurity standards.</li>
        <li class={p}><strong>Counterfeit Prevention:</strong> We maintain strict procurement pipelines to ensure all networking hardware, servers, and security appliances are authentic and free from supply chain tampering.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="contact-Us" class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <h2 id="contact-Us" class={h2}>Contact Us</h2>
      <p class={p}>
        For inquiries regarding our corporate governance policies, or to make a confidential report, please contact:
      </p>
      <address class="mt-3 rounded-lg bg-brand-75 p-4 text-base/[1.7] not-italic text-copy">
        <strong class="text-brand-900">{COMPANY.legalName}</strong><br />
        {COMPANY.address}<br />
        Email: <a href={`mailto:${COMPANY.supportEmail}`} class={link}>{COMPANY.supportEmail}</a><br />
        Phone: <a href={COMPANY.phone.href} class={link}>{COMPANY.phone.display}</a>
      </address>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>